<title>CANADA: Canada government cash balances fall in week.</title>
<headline>Canada government cash balances fall in week.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The government of Canada's cash balances fell in the week that ended July 23, the Bank of Canada said on Friday.</p>
<p>					Wk to Jy 23  Chg on wk Chg on yr</p>
<p>Notes in circulation		  28.10   -0.040    +1.103</p>
<p>Government cash balances	     4.94   -1.958    -0.561</p>
<p>Govt securities outstanding	457.22   -0.424    -6.172</p>
<p>Treasury bills			 122.40   -0.400   -31.400</p>
<p>Canada savings bonds		  32.17   -0.020    +1.925</p>
<p>All figures in billions of dollars.</p>
</text>
